                {
                    "en": "Simple past tense of break.",
                    "vi": "Thì quá khứ đơn của break."
                },
                {
                    "en": "(archaic or poetic) Past participle of break. (nautical) Demoted, deprived of a commission. He was broke and rendered unfit to serve His Majesty at sea.",
